;; Public-global resource-flow citation catalog for axis-ingest.
;;
;; README / PROJECT.jsonld claim a global resource-flow intelligence surface.
;; The declared product host (global.etzhayyim.com) did not resolve at catalog
;; write time (curl connect failure) — it is NOT cited here. Citations are the
;; public statistical / geospatial feeds such a platform would refresh from,
;; plus schema and self-surface pins that make the claim falsifiable.
;;
;; Gate: `kbb --backend sci tools/verify_citations.cljk` must exit 0. Do not add a URL that
;; does not return 2xx under that gate.

{:catalog/id "public-global/resource-flow-sources/v1"
 :catalog/about
 "Public statistical and geospatial endpoints that a global resource-flow
  catalogue is designed to refresh from. Citations make the README claim
  falsifiable without inventing a live product host."

 ;; The floor the live gate holds the catalogue to. Declared HERE rather than
 ;; left to a flag default so that emptying the catalogue cannot quietly pass:
 ;; `tools/verify_citations.cljk` reads this, and `test/public_global/
 ;; records_test.cljc` fails if the two drift apart or if the floor sinks far
 ;; below the real count. A floor of 8 against 28 rows would have to lose most
 ;; of the catalogue before it noticed.
 :catalog/min-citations 28

 :catalog/entries
